          "alt": "The marking scheme's own print of its answer to 2022 HL Q10(c)(iv), as the State Examinations Commission set it: 0.004 moles N or 0.002 moles N₂ (4), with the working 2.4 × 10²¹ over 6 × 10²³ = 0.004 moles NO₂, so 0.004 moles N (4); then the empirical formula C₁₆H₁₈N₂O₄S (6), with C : H : N : O : S = 0.032 : 0.036 : 0.004 : 0.008 : 0.002 (2), divide by the smallest number of moles (3) and C₁₆H₁₈N₂O₄S (1), and the notes.",
