    questionText: "State Hess’s law. The heats of formation of dodecane, but-2-ene, 2-methylbutane and X are –350.9, –9.3, –178.4 and 20.0 kJ mol⁻¹ respectively. Use the data to calculate the heat change for the cracking reaction:",
