    section: "B", questionRef: "2017 HL Q10(a)(i)",
    stem: "A student determined the relative molecular mass of a volatile liquid by vaporising a known mass of the liquid at a known temperature and pressure. The student recorded that 0.28 g of the volatile liquid occupied a volume of 268 cm³ when vapourised at a temperature of 98 °C and at a pressure of 101 kPa.",
