          "srcHash": "c3ad73d29451b52e22bfa579f0411331",
          "alt": "The marking scheme's own print of its answer to 2017 HL Q11(a)(i), as the State Examinations Commission set it: three boxed routes. Mr azurite = 344.5* (3); 3.81 over 63.5 = 0.06 moles Cu ⇒ 0.02 (1/50) moles azurite (3); m over 344.5 = 0.02 moles, m = 6.89 g azurite (3) / Mr azurite = 344.5* (3); 3 × 63.5 over 344.5 × 100 = 55.2975 – 55.30% Cu (3); 3.81 over 0.5530 = m, m = 6.8896 – 6.89 g azurite (3) / Mr azurite = 344.5* (3); 3 × 63.5 g Cu in 344.5 g azurite / 190.5 g Cu in 344.5 g azurite (3); 3.81 g Cu ⇒ 344.5×3.81 over 3×63.5 / 344.5×3.81 over 190.5 = 6.89 g azurite (3); then [*Addition must be shown for error to be treated as slip.]",
