          "alt": "The marking scheme's own print of its answer to 2015 HL Q4(j), as the State Examinations Commission set it: three boxed routes, each after \"or\". Shaded, 1.85 × 10⁵ × 6.50 × 10⁻⁵ = n × 8.3 × 293 / n = 1.85 × 10⁵ × 6.50 × 10⁻⁵ over 8.3 × 293 (3); = 0.005 (5 × 10⁻³) (3). P₁V₁ over T₁ = P₂V₂ over T₂ * => 1.85 × 10⁵ × 6.50 × 10⁻⁵ over 293 = 1.01 × 10⁵ × V₂ over 273 => V₂ = 1.11 × 10⁻⁴ m³ (3); 1.11 × 10⁻⁴ over 22.4 × 10⁻³ = 0.005 (5 × 10⁻³) \"[*Using standard T & P and molar volume at s.t.p.]\" (3). P₁V₁ = P₂V₂** => 1.85 × 10⁵ × 6.50 × 10⁻⁵ = 1.01 × 10⁵ × V₂ => V₂ = 1.19 × 10⁻⁴ m³ (3); 1.19 × 10⁻⁴ over 24.0 × 10⁻³ = 0.005 (5 × 10⁻³) \"[**Using room T & P and molar volume at room temperature.]\" (3).",
